<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/064a0c1a-f768-4453-a3d6-4a347facde4f/node_1784888415122> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Description" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/064a0c1a-f768-4453-a3d6-4a347facde4f/node_1784888591614> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskControl> .
